  "details": "Some users on my friends list, that I occasionally meet, sometimes change their name. This results in not knowing who they are sometimes.\n So, the feature I'd like to see added is maybe a button, opening a separate window, or drop-down list displaying the users previous names. This can be housed in the user's Details Panel menu, and the button placement can be left of the user's name. All this showing only if the user is your friend.",
